{"3502510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Moon Drop Miners", "steam_appid": 3502510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Moon Drop Miners is a high-stakes resource management roguelite about building and optimizing a fragile mining operation on unstable moons.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Slam down structures</strong> and watch your resource numbers rise or plummet. Every structure you drop can boost intake or push your rig to the brink of collapse. It’s all about balancing resources to keep your rig operational and your moon in one piece.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502510/extras/3f1875da3ef0d5f5bb911d16191417fa.poster.avif?t=1777609137\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502510/extras/3f1875da3ef0d5f5bb911d16191417fa.webm?t=1777609137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502510/extras/3f1875da3ef0d5f5bb911d16191417fa.mp4?t=1777609137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Every decision counts</strong> as quotas rise and pressure mounts. Extract too slowly and fall behind or push too hard and risk total collapse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502510/extras/f371c767751c9c2f8db606c7b75ac1de.poster.avif?t=1777609137\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502510/extras/f371c767751c9c2f8db606c7b75ac1de.webm?t=1777609137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502510/extras/f371c767751c9c2f8db606c7b75ac1de.mp4?t=1777609137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Earn cash</strong> and discover new ways to power up your rig. From game altering unlocks to specialized satellites, every improvement helps you delve deeper, extract more, and meet your next quota. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502510/extras/22779afefe43b90f4f88187853d5590d.poster.avif?t=1777609137\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502510/extras/22779afefe43b90f4f88187853d5590d.webm?t=1777609137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502510/extras/22779afefe43b90f4f88187853d5590d.mp4?t=1777609137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>75 Structures, Each with 2 Upgrades</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>75 Satellites</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Distinct Moons</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 Difficulty Levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synthwave Space Rock Soundtrack  </strong> <br><strong>  </strong> </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Moon Drop Miners is a high-stakes resource management roguelite about building and optimizing a fragile mining operation on unstable moons.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Slam down structures</strong> and watch your resource numbers rise or plummet. Every structure you drop can boost intake or push your rig to the brink of collapse. It’s all about balancing resources to keep your rig operational and your moon in one piece.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502510/extras/3f1875da3ef0d5f5bb911d16191417fa.poster.avif?t=1777609137\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502510/extras/3f1875da3ef0d5f5bb911d16191417fa.webm?t=1777609137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502510/extras/3f1875da3ef0d5f5bb911d16191417fa.mp4?t=1777609137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Every decision counts</strong> as quotas rise and pressure mounts. Extract too slowly and fall behind or push too hard and risk total collapse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502510/extras/f371c767751c9c2f8db606c7b75ac1de.poster.avif?t=1777609137\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502510/extras/f371c767751c9c2f8db606c7b75ac1de.webm?t=1777609137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502510/extras/f371c767751c9c2f8db606c7b75ac1de.mp4?t=1777609137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Earn cash</strong> and discover new ways to power up your rig. From game altering unlocks to specialized satellites, every improvement helps you delve deeper, extract more, and meet your next quota. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502510/extras/22779afefe43b90f4f88187853d5590d.poster.avif?t=1777609137\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.